        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-connectors-p08-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "clause + 并且 + clause",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "并且 links compatible clauses, adding a further point. It does not express an alternative choice.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他会说中文，并且会写汉字。",
                "pinyin": "tā huì shuō Zhōngwén ， bìngqiě huì xiě Hànzì 。",
                "meaning": "He can speak Chinese and can also write Chinese characters.",
                "audio": "8df16c4d59879b0e6d2911d5e519a909f40b89decf7e19d91a448df81542e04c"
              },
              {
                "text": "这里安静，并且很干净。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ ānjìng ， bìngqiě hěn gānjìng 。",
                "meaning": "It is quiet here and also very clean.",
                "audio": "04defad4a77bcdb596075f52870d7e9217c45efb7f37038defdc90040a1c1e94"
              }
            ]
